则中阻止对 TCP/UDP 1900 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21389","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21389.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21389.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21389.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21389.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21389/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21389.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21389/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21389.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2025/CVE-2025-21389.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21389"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0851.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0851.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0845","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0845.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21382","title":"Microsoft Windows 图形组件特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 图形组件存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞 (CWE-122) 和整数溢出漏洞 (CWE-190)。已获得低权限的本地攻击者可通过运行特制应用程序调用图形组件接口，触发堆缓冲区溢出，从而将权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。攻击无需用户交互，成功利用后可导致任意代码执行、数据泄露及系统完全控制。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022/2025 等多个版本。","se