le_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0841.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21378","title":"Microsoft Windows CSC 服务权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows CSC 服务（Client Side Caching，客户端缓存）中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，该服务负责管理脱机文件同步功能。由于对用户输入的内存分配大小校验不足，低权限攻击者可通过向系统发送特制的请求触发堆缓冲区溢出，成功利用此漏洞可提升至 SYSTEM 权限并执行任意代码。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多个版本。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21378"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:14Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050004），更新 Windows CSC 服务组件至修复版本。受影响系统包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多个版本，可通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 获取补丁。无法立即更新的系统应限制本地用户登录权限，并监控异常进程提权行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21378","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21378.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21378.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21378.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21378.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21378/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21378.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21378/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21378.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc250cf8fdc59c77fa474d34589422db608209f4/2025/CVE-2025-21378.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c