E.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21374.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21374/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21374.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2025/CVE-2025-21374.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21374"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0837.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0835","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0835.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21372","title":"Microsoft 代理文件系统特权提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Brokering File System（代理文件系统）存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，CWE-416。具有低权限的本地攻击者可通过特制程序调用触发已释放内存的访问，导致权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高（AC:H），但无需用户交互即可利用，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。影响所有受支持的 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 版本，Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5049984）中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21372"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:13Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5049984，通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 获取。该更新修复了 Microsoft Brokering File System 中的 Use-After-Free 漏洞，可防止本地攻击者提升至 SYSTEM 权限。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地用户登录受影响系统并监控异常进程创建行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21372","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21372.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21372.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21372.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21372.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21372.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21372.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21372.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21372/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b7a3f185461ada4598db88be1e2c953e4d2cddec/2025/CVE-2025-21372.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21372/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0835.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0833","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0833.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21370","title":"Microsoft Windows 基于虚拟化的安全性(VBS) Enclave 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 基于虚拟化的安全性（VBS）Enclave 存在特权提升漏洞（CVE-2025-21370），根源在于 VBS 安全内存管理器对 Enclave 边界内数据的输入验证不充分（CWE-20 输入验证缺陷），导致攻击者可通过特制应用程序绕过虚拟化安全隔离边界。攻击条件为本地访问且需具备低权限，攻击复杂度低、无需用户交互，成功利用后可获取 SYSTEM 权限，完全控制受影响系统、窃取敏感信息或安装持久化后门，影响机密性、完整性与可用性。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多个版本，Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5050021 中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21370"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:12Z","remediation":"Let me analyze the presearch data to find the specific remediation information for CVE-2025-21370.\n\nFrom the presearch data:\n1. NVD reference: https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21370\n2. Tenable data mentions security update 5050021 (KB5050021)\n3. The vulnerability affects Windows VBS Enclave\n4. Microsoft released a security update in January 2025\n\nThe remediation should:\n- Be ≥20 Chinese characters\n- Be specific and actionable\n- Reference the patch/update version\n- Not be generic like \"请参考官方公告\"\n\nLet me write a proper remediation based on the availabledata.立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050021）。操作步骤：打开\"设置\"→\"更新和安全\"→\"Windows 更新\"→点击\"检查更新\"以自动获取该累积更新；对于离线环境，从 Microsoft Update Catalog（https://www.catalog.update.microsoft.com）手动下载 KB5050021 并执行安装，完成后重启系统。该更新修复了 Windows 基于虚拟化的安全性（VBS）Enclave 中的输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20），阻止攻击者利用特制应用提升至 SYSTEM 权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21370","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21370.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21370.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21370.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21370.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21370.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21370.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21370.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21370/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f9ec51bb42a17e0dd0492f440cee3d253cc8275e/2025/CVE-2025-21370.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21370/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0833.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0828","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0828.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21366","title":"Microsoft Access 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Access 存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的 Access 数据库文件触发该漏洞，成功利用可在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码，实现完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特权，但需要用户交互配合。影响 Microsoft Office 系列产品中的 Access 组件，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21366"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:12Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新：Access 2016 用户升级至 16.0.5483.1001 及以上版本；Microsoft 365 Apps for Enterprise、Office 2019/2021/2024 LTSC 用户通过 aka.ms/OfficeSecurityReleases 获取更新，或启用 Windows Update 自动推送。临时缓解措施：不要打开来自不可信来源的 Access 数据库文件（.accdb/.mdb），并在受影响的 Office 版本中禁用宏执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21366","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21366.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21366.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21366.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21366.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21366.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21366.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21366.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21366/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2025/CVE-2025-21366.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21366/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0828.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0827","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0827.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21365","title":"Microsoft Office 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 存在远程代码执行漏洞（CWE-426 不可信搜索路径）。该漏洞源于 Office 在加载组件时未充分验证搜索路径中的文件，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的恶意文件触发漏洞。攻击条件为本地访问且需用户交互（如点击打开恶意文档），无需任何用户权限。成功利用后攻击者可在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码，若用户以管理员权限运行则可完全控制系统。该漏洞影响 Microsoft 365 Apps for Enterprise 及 Office LTSC 2024 等产品，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21365"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:12Z","remediation":"建议立即通过 Windows Update 自动更新功能安装 2025 年 1 月安全更新，或访问 Microsoft 安全响应中心 https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21365 手动下载并安装补丁。受影响的 Microsoft 365 Apps 企业版及 Office LTSC 2024 用户应升级至最新版本。该漏洞为不可信搜索路径（CWE-426）导致的 DLL 劫持类远程代码执行，需用户交互触发；在无法立即打补丁期间，应避免从不受信任的来源打开 Office 文档，并在组策略中启用「阻止来自 Internet 的 Office 文件运行宏」作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21365","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2025/CVE-2025-21365.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2025/CVE-2025-21365.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21365.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21365.json","https