b/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21364.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21364.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21364.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21364.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21364.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21364.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21364/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2025/CVE-2025-21364.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21364/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0826.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0825","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0825.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21363","title":"Microsoft Word 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Word 存在不受信任指针解引用（Untrusted Pointer Dereference）漏洞，攻击者可构造特制的 Office 文档并诱使用户打开，触发该漏洞导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Office 多个版本，攻击者成功利用后可获取与当前用户相同的系统权限，实现完全控制目标系统。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时安装补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21363"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:11Z","remediation":"建议立即通过 Windows 更新或 Microsoft 官网安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（对应 Word 版本 KB），升级至该修复版本解决 CVE-2025-21363 远程代码执行漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，可采取缓解措施：在组织内禁止用户使用管理员身份运行 Office，通过组策略启用 Office 文件打开时的受保护视图（Protected View），并配置 ASR（攻击面减少）规则阻止可疑宏与 OLE 对象执行，同时避免打开来源不明的 .docx 文档。","status":"completed