-01-14T18:16:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:11Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新。对于 Microsoft Excel 2016，升级至 16.0.5483.1001 及以上版本；对于 Office LTSC for Mac 2021/2024，升级至 16.93.25011212 及以上版本；对于 Office Online Server，升级至 16.0.10416.20047 及以上版本；Microsoft 365 Apps for Enterprise 用户可通过 Microsoft Update 自动获取修复。如无法立即打补丁，建议在受影响的 Excel 实例上启用受保护视图（Protected View）并阻止来自不受信任来源的文档宏执行，以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21362","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21362.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21362.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21362.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21362.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21362.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21362.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21362/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21362.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2025/CVE-2025-21362.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21362/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0824.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0823","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0823.toml","cve_i